{"seq":3,"slug":"exchange-price-difference-settle","title":"换货价差结算与多退少补","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/exchange-reship-fulfillment/exchange-transaction-inventory/exchange-price-difference-settle","wordCount":2177,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"换货价差结算与多退少补\">换货价差结算与多退少补</h1><p>换货里最容易产生纠纷的不是货，是钱。买家把 100 美元的商品换成 130 美元的商品，卖家需要收 30 美元；换成 80 美元的商品，卖家需要退 20 美元。听起来是简单的减法，但在跨境支付通道上，这两个方向的能力完全不对称：退款可以自动执行，补收做不到。这一篇讲清楚为什么不对称、以及在这个约束下价差该怎么结算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-价差的两个方向不是对称操作\">核心概念：价差的两个方向不是对称操作</h2><h3 id=\"退款通道的方向性硬约束\">退款通道的方向性硬约束</h3><p>先把约束说清楚。<strong>退款只能回到原支付方式，且累计退款不能超过原笔金额。</strong> 这是支付通道的硬规则而非平台策略：Stripe 的文档明确写「退款只能退回到原交易使用的支付方式，不能退到另一个目的地」，「可以对一笔支付发起多次退款，但退款总额不能超过原始金额」（<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/refunds\">Stripe 退款文档</a>）。这条约束对换货的直接影响是：换到更便宜的商品可以自动退差额，换到更贵的商品<strong>不能</strong>通过「负退款」实现，必须让买家再发起一笔支付。</p>\n<p>这个不对称带来三个工程推论。第一，价差方向的判定必须发生在换货单创建阶段，而不是发货之后——因为如果是补收方向，必须先把钱收到才能发货，否则卖家承担全部风险。第二，补收路径需要一套独立的「应收」对象与催收状态机，它和退款路径共享金额计算但流程完全不同。第三，<strong>同一笔换货的价差只能走一个方向</strong>：如果新旧商品之间存在多个价格成分（商品价、运费、税费、优惠券），必须先把这些成分合并成一个净额再判定方向，否则会出现「商品价退 20 但运费需补 5」这种无法执行的双向结算。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>items</mtext></mrow></munder><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mtext>new</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mtext>old</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>new</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>old</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>new</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>old</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>retained</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta = \\sum_{i \\in \\text{items}} \\big( p_{\\text{new},i} - p_{\\text{old},i} \\big) + \\big( s_{\\text{new}} - s_{\\text{old}} \\big) + \\big( t_{\\text{new}} - t_{\\text{old}} \\big) - c_{\\text{retained}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3609em;vertical-align:-1.3109em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8665em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">items</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3109em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">new</span></span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">old</span></span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">new</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">old</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">new</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">old</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">retained</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 是商品单价，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 是运费，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 是税费，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>retained</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{retained}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">retained</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是保留在原单上不再退还的优惠额度（优惠券通常按比例分摊到商品上，换货后需要重新分摊）。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 是补收方向，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta &lt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 是退款方向，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 无账务动作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"价差成分的处理顺序\">价差成分的处理顺序</h2><p>把上面这个公式拆开看，每个成分都有自己的坑。</p>\n<p><strong>商品价</strong>：换码换色时不同变体可能定价不同（大码加价是常见策略），因此「同商品族」不代表零价差。异款换货的定价应以当前目录价还是原单成交价为准，是一个需要明确的产品决策——以原单成交价为准会保证买家不吃亏但可能让卖家亏本；以目录价为准会产生补收但可能引发争议。工程上更稳的做法是记录两个价格并让策略表决定取哪个。</p>\n<p><strong>运费</strong>：跨境运费通常是按件或按重量计算的。换一件更重的商品，运费会变。这里有一个容易被忽略的点：换货的运费责任归属不由价差公式决定，而由责任判定决定（见 <a href=\"../reship-cost-customs/reship-shipping-fault-attribution\">补发运费责任归属</a>）。如果原单是卖家责任（漏发/错发），那换货的运费由卖家承担，价差公式里的运费项应当归零而不是按差额计算。</p>\n<p><strong>税费</strong>：跨境订单的进口增值税与关税随商品价值变化。换到更贵的商品，可能跨过一个免税门槛（比如欧盟 IOSS 的 150 欧元内在价值门槛），从而使整单从「已含税」变成「需要在进口时补税」。这个判断必须在创建换货单时做，因为它会改变买家的实际支付总额。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>价差成分</th>\n<th>变化来源</th>\n<th>结算方式</th>\n<th>常见错误</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>商品价</td>\n<td>变体定价差异 / 换到不同商品</td>\n<td>按策略取目录价或成交价</td>\n<td>两个价格都没存，无法溯源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运费</td>\n<td>件数/重量差异</td>\n<td>责任判定优先于差额计算</td>\n<td>把责任判定漏掉，向买家收了他不该付的钱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>进口税</td>\n<td>价值跨越免税门槛</td>\n<td>重算税费并明确谁承担</td>\n<td>只算商品价，忽略税费跳档</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优惠分摊</td>\n<td>优惠券按比例分摊到商品</td>\n<td>按剩余商品重新分摊</td>\n<td>换货后优惠重复使用或凭空消失</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"结算对象与状态机\">结算对象与状态机</h2><h3 id=\"为什么价差必须是独立对象\">为什么价差必须是独立对象</h3><p>价差不能只记一个 <code>amount</code> 字段，因为它的生命周期跨越了「计算 → 确认 → 执行 → 到账」。把它建成独立对象，是因为退款与应收这两条路径的执行状态机不同，而它们在业务上又是同一个「价差」的两个分支。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE exchange_settlement (&#10;  settlement_id   BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  exchange_id     BIGINT      NOT NULL UNIQUE&#10;                  REFERENCES exchange_order(exchange_id),&#10;  direction       TEXT        NOT NULL&#10;                  CHECK (direction IN (&#39;COLLECT&#39;,&#39;REFUND&#39;,&#39;NONE&#39;)),&#10;  amount_minor    BIGINT      NOT NULL,&#10;  currency        CHAR(3)     NOT NULL,&#10;  breakdown       JSONB       NOT NULL,&#10;&#10;  state           TEXT        NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;COMPUTED&#39;&#10;                  CHECK (state IN&#10;                    (&#39;COMPUTED&#39;,&#39;AWAITING_PAYMENT&#39;,&#39;PAID&#39;,&#10;                     &#39;REFUNDING&#39;,&#39;REFUNDED&#39;,&#39;WAIVED&#39;,&#39;FAILED&#39;)),&#10;&#10;  psp_refund_id   TEXT,&#10;  psp_payment_id  TEXT,&#10;  idempotency_key TEXT        NOT NULL UNIQUE,&#10;  computed_at     TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  settled_at      TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;&#10;  CONSTRAINT amount_sign CHECK (&#10;    (direction = &#39;COLLECT&#39; AND amount_minor &gt; 0)&#10;    OR (direction = &#39;REFUND&#39; AND amount_minor &gt; 0)&#10;    OR (direction = &#39;NONE&#39;  AND amount_minor = 0)&#10;  ),&#10;  CONSTRAINT psps_ref_present CHECK (&#10;    (state NOT IN (&#39;PAID&#39;,&#39;REFUNDED&#39;)) OR&#10;    (psp_refund_id IS NOT NULL OR psp_payment_id IS NOT NULL)&#10;  )&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> exchange_settlement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  settlement_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  exchange_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNIQUE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                  REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> exchange_order(exchange_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  direction       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                  CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (direction </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'COLLECT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'REFUND'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'NONE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  amount_minor    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  breakdown       JSONB       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'COMPUTED'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                  CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                    (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'COMPUTED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'AWAITING_PAYMENT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PAID'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                     'REFUNDING'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'REFUNDED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'WAIVED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'FAILED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  psp_refund_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  psp_payment_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  idempotency_key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  computed_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  settled_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount_sign </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    (direction </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'COLLECT'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount_minor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    OR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (direction </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'REFUND'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount_minor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    OR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (direction </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'NONE'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount_minor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> psps_ref_present </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PAID'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'REFUNDED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    (psp_refund_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> OR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> psp_payment_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三个设计点。<strong><code>breakdown</code> 存 JSONB</strong>：价差的构成成分随政策变化，用结构化 JSON 保留计算明细，能在争议时回答「这 30 美元是怎么来的」，而不必回头重算一遍可能已经变了的目录价。<strong><code>idempotency_key</code> 唯一</strong>：退款与补收都是外部副作用，必须在表层面去重，避免重试造成重复退款——这与支付系统的幂等键是同一个模式。<strong><code>state</code> 把补收路径与退款路径分开</strong>：<code>AWAITING_PAYMENT</code> 只属于补收方向，<code>REFUNDING</code> 只属于退款方向，两个分支共享 <code>COMPUTED</code> 与终态。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[COMPUTED 计算完成] --&gt; B{方向}&#10;  B --&gt;|REFUND| C[REFUNDING]&#10;  B --&gt;|COLLECT| D[AWAITING_PAYMENT]&#10;  B --&gt;|NONE| E[WAIVED]&#10;  C --&gt;|通道成功| F[REFUNDED]&#10;  C --&gt;|通道失败| G[FAILED]&#10;  D --&gt;|买家支付成功| H[PAID]&#10;  D --&gt;|超时未支付| I[换货单取消]&#10;  G --&gt; J[人工介入&lt;br/&gt;改走其他退款路径]&#10;  I --&gt; K[释放库存预占]\">graph TD\n  A[COMPUTED 计算完成] --&gt; B{方向}\n  B --&gt;|REFUND| C[REFUNDING]\n  B --&gt;|COLLECT| D[AWAITING_PAYMENT]\n  B --&gt;|NONE| E[WAIVED]\n  C --&gt;|通道成功| F[REFUNDED]\n  C --&gt;|通道失败| G[FAILED]\n  D --&gt;|买家支付成功| H[PAID]\n  D --&gt;|超时未支付| I[换货单取消]\n  G --&gt; J[人工介入&lt;br/&gt;改走其他退款路径]\n  I --&gt; K[释放库存预占]</pre><p>注意 <code>FAILED</code> 不是终态而是需要人工介入的状态。退款失败在跨境场景下并不罕见（卡已注销、银行账户关闭），Stripe 文档列出的失败原因包括 <code>expired_or_canceled_card</code>、<code>lost_or_stolen_card</code>、<code>insufficient_funds</code> 等，并且失败的退款资金会在最多 30 天后回到账户余额（<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/refunds\">Stripe 退款文档</a>）。这意味着系统必须能表达「退过一次但失败了、现在要换一种方式退」，而不是把失败当成成功。</p>\n<h2 id=\"优惠分摊的重算\">优惠分摊的重算</h2><h3 id=\"优惠券使-新价减旧价-不等于退款额\">优惠券使「新价减旧价」不等于退款额</h3><p>优惠券在换货里是高频争议点，值得单独说。一张「满 200 减 30」的券作用在含两件商品的订单上时，通常按商品金额比例分摊到每件上。换掉其中一件之后，分摊基础变了：剩下的那件可能不再满足券的使用门槛。</p>\n<p>正确的处理是把优惠当作<strong>原单的属性而非商品的属性</strong>，并在换货时重算两件事：券是否仍然有效（门槛是否仍满足），以及券的金额如何在新商品组合上分摊。如果换货后门槛不再满足，券的剩余金额应当被回收——但这会与「退款不超过原额」的约束相互作用：回收优惠会减少退款金额，买家实际拿到的钱可能少于「新价 − 旧价」的直观差额。这个差异必须在换货确认页上明确展示，否则它会在争议阶段变成一笔解释不清的扣款。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>价差的<strong>两个方向能力不对称</strong>：退款只能回原支付方式且总额不超过原笔金额，补收必须让买家重新支付，因此二者是不同的状态机。</li>\n<li>价差必须在<strong>换货单创建阶段</strong>判定方向；补收方向应先收款再发货，否则风险全在卖家。</li>\n<li>价差公式要把<strong>商品价、运费、税费、优惠分摊</strong>合并成一个净额再判方向；运费项要被责任判定覆盖而不是简单做差。</li>\n<li>价差是<strong>独立对象</strong>，用唯一幂等键防重复退款，用结构化 <code>breakdown</code> 保留可溯源的构成明细。</li>\n<li>退款失败（卡注销、账户关闭）是<strong>需要人工介入的中间态</strong>，系统必须能表达「换一种方式退」，而不是当作已退。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"与其他篇的边界\">与其他篇的边界</h2><p>换货价差只处理「同一买家、同一订单、商品替换产生的净额」。补发产生的费用（运费、关税、原品损失）不走这张表，它们由第 3 章的费用归集模型处理，见 <a href=\"../reship-cost-customs/reship-shipping-fault-attribution\">补发运费责任归属（平台/卖家/买家）</a>。价差与补发费用在账簿上可能落到同一个售后成本科目，但归集口径必须分开，否则一次换货政策调整与一次承运商质量下降会表现出相同的成本曲线，无法区分。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"换货价差结算与多退少补","id":"换货价差结算与多退少补"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：价差的两个方向不是对称操作","id":"核心概念-价差的两个方向不是对称操作"},{"level":3,"text":"退款通道的方向性硬约束","id":"退款通道的方向性硬约束"},{"level":2,"text":"价差成分的处理顺序","id":"价差成分的处理顺序"},{"level":2,"text":"结算对象与状态机","id":"结算对象与状态机"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么价差必须是独立对象","id":"为什么价差必须是独立对象"},{"level":2,"text":"优惠分摊的重算","id":"优惠分摊的重算"},{"level":3,"text":"优惠券使「新价减旧价」不等于退款额","id":"优惠券使-新价减旧价-不等于退款额"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"与其他篇的边界","id":"与其他篇的边界"}],"prev":{"title":"换货库存预留与可得性（联034）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/exchange-reship-fulfillment/exchange-transaction-inventory/exchange-inventory-hold-availability"},"next":{"title":"漏发/少件/错发/破损/丢失判定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/exchange-reship-fulfillment/reship-decision-scenario/missing-short-wrong-damaged-lost"}}